# Ordered XNU patches shared by every SDM710 port, one path per line.
#
# native-smp-secondary: the BCM2837 (4 KiB) personality starts at MAX_CPUS = 4 and numbers its
# cores in Affinity0; SDM710 has eight cores numbered in Affinity1 (0x000..0x700). Without this
# patch the kernel caps at four CPUs and computes the wrong CPU number on secondary start.
# Upstream keeps the patch next to the SM8550 patches instead of in the ARM64 series; carry it
# here until the ARM64 series owns it, then delete the copy.
native-smp-secondary.patch
